{"version":1,"key":"card:396","content":{"id":396,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"886348c1-9370-4212-a9ac-d2e3a20c041f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在工作中经常会频繁的 commit 代码，但是过多的提交信息，让人很难发现我们到底做了什么功能，最好是在最终提交之前，能把我们的 commit 合并为一个，那么问题是如何进行合并呢。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"16553d53-9176-4d42-9fca-47544babca17","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先新建一个仓库，创建一个 hello.txt，然后进行提交"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"b29588e6-6dad-4a06-98d7-e110e0254ba0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f69fbf0f-67b8-4e72-a1e3-56c052ff83e4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ git init\n$ touch hello.txt\n$ git add .\n$ git commit -m \"init\"\n$ git log --oneline\nf743f33 (HEAD -> master) init","collabId":"386559e6-1c7b-4ed3-bd38-7f6e8baa2ec2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fa0c4c17-e5a2-4a6c-8dbe-03445317505e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面我们要开发一个新功能，切换到 feature 分支，并创建了三个提交，每次提交都是向 hello.txt 中添加一行"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"83c159dc-d3f7-4dd8-a70b-611e7c8c1567","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6751a493-8511-405b-baed-4c0d4652171c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ git checkout -b feature\n$ git log --oneline\n0f5f898 (HEAD -> feature) test: c\n6d4e731 fix: b\nbad5b39 feat: a\nf743f33 (master) init","collabId":"29081953-213f-4b25-bb80-c09c5afae355","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f98656e-877a-45d7-a2d2-7a20681d89f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们想把最近三次的提交合并为一个提交，首先找到我们想合并为一个提交的前一个提交的 commit id，即 init 的 commit id f743f33，然后执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"git rebase -i f743f33"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"5eccadbf-c044-43cd-9182-7e04f5b19485","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e009520b-59ae-44f7-bf59-9f71b6348c05","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ git rebase -i f743f33","collabId":"7b145ef3-4774-4563-a0f8-88a86a4f24b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d60ec2a9-a401-4596-83e9-4e40b28e0de1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着会出现打开一个编辑器，内容如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"1691aeb5-e11a-42fb-8673-af9404ce584c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8beb32f3-e3a3-4af7-9220-81bbde739e63","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"pick bad5b39 feat: a\npick 6d4e731 fix: b\npick 0f5f898 test: c\n\n# Rebase f743f33..0f5f898 onto f743f33 (3 commands)\n#\n# Commands:\n# p, pick <commit> = use commit\n# r, reword <commit> = use commit, but edit the commit message\n# e, edit <commit> = use commit, but stop for amending\n# s, squash <commit> = use commit, but meld into previous commit\n# f, fixup [-C | -c] <commit> = like \"squash\" but keep only the previous\n#                    commit's log message, unless -C is used, in which case\n#                    keep only this commit's message; -c is same as -C but\n#                    opens the editor\n# x, exec <command> = run command (the rest of the line) using shell\n# b, break = stop here (continue rebase later with 'git rebase --continue')\n# d, drop <commit> = remove commit\n# l, label <label> = label current HEAD with a name\n# t, reset <label> = reset HEAD to a label\n# m, merge [-C <commit> | -c <commit>] <label> [# <oneline>]\n# .       create a merge commit using the original merge commit's\n# .       message (or the oneline, if no original merge commit was\n# .       specified); use -c <commit> to reword the commit message\n#\n# These lines can be re-ordered; they are executed from top to bottom.\n#\n# If you remove a line here THAT COMMIT WILL BE LOST.","collabId":"b1600b72-f6f2-441b-bc47-ec078f49dcf7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f13330a-4713-4baa-b15d-29dfea309959","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前面三行是我们的三个提交，下面都是操作说明，其中有一行表示"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"5d5a8040-a322-4351-bc5a-50c31116da6f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"983204f0-370f-4d79-94bd-fd327e15fc8b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# s, squash <commit> = use commit, but meld into previous commit","collabId":"0f858568-4488-496a-9030-d2631cdb00e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86d1e52d-808f-4979-b03b-04f5fb060db8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们把要与前面的 commit 合并的提交由 pick 改为 s，即"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"748a689b-4ee5-4990-9b9c-893c35ff0994","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a73164c7-79af-4b60-b34d-a2a58bdf7953","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"pick bad5b39 feat: a\ns 6d4e731 fix: b\ns 0f5f898 test: c","collabId":"2d729ab4-4269-419c-978c-24e76652d027","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f6e6f75-9632-4948-ad6e-01a6b7f126c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后保存退出，接下来会又会打开一个编辑器，让你写合并为一个提交后的 commit 信息"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"ec9740be-fc7f-4bcc-8f28-cc5208b0d464","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3f003b3b-607d-4fb4-878e-974c8dc8baf9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# This is a combination of 3 commits.\n# This is the 1st commit message:\n\nfeat: a\n\n# This is the commit message #2:\n\nfix: b\n\n# This is the commit message #3:\n\ntest: c","collabId":"d2aa5f53-e720-4bd4-bb7c-1d66e6a9c355","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f6d19db1-f3a1-48b6-8fba-10d9d76cc7d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"简单的把上面的内容改为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"fb0a8a52-60be-4ec8-a3be-69d2bf75bff2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"70acecb2-c204-46df-815e-83ee9b5265b5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"feat: feature","collabId":"ebd33403-5994-4d14-8423-d9c8d9efd7ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8eeed46b-e234-425a-a5f3-290ce0cedbaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后保存退出，这次再次查看提交信息，发现那三个合并为一个了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"4df76cdb-65b1-4a64-88a0-ec36ecada80b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b6ad19ce-b4c5-4d08-80c2-14118fe1d4ba","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ git log --oneline\n5a92146 (HEAD -> feature) feat: feature\nf743f33 (master) init","collabId":"2629f680-9fc7-4f5e-8644-98fa6f88a715","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ce6641b-43eb-4160-9e8a-c580f3472c7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果多个 commit 之间有冲突，我们需要先解决冲突，然后运行下面的代码继续"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"9cd747db-fec8-49a0-8cbe-bc9571540bb4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b42b4e44-0ba3-446a-9d1a-4c97bf24ed24","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"git add .\ngit rebase --continue","collabId":"d084b56a-6826-4ac9-8131-cf5c39b3b1a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c22c2256-2977-477a-b76f-c3ed5eda4b07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果要终止合并，可以运行"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"d1e6c812-8a57-4f65-9ff9-d64d8e99c0a1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6629abfa-acf7-4a65-9977-00376242e7c3","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"git rebase --abort","collabId":"c911da51-ca20-496e-863d-22feb1b3b6dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Git/技巧","技巧/Git"],"createTime":1704809494422,"updateTime":1744171297869,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744171297869}}